<title>BELGIUM: Belgian industrial output up 12.4% yr/yr in July.</title>
<headline>Belgian industrial output up 12.4% yr/yr in July.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Statistics Institute released the following indices for production in industry excluding the construction sector -</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION	    July 96    June 96	 July 95</p>
<p> work day index (1990=100) (*)    81.8	106.5	    72.8</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) index per working day, adjusted for length and composition of the months  </p>
<p> SEASONALLY ADJUSTED INDICES(*) July 96    June 96    July 95</p>
<p> industry as a whole		 94.3	 93.6	 94.6</p>
<p> construction industry	     76.0	 75.3	 85.9</p>
<p> investment goods		   101.2	100.0	 98.0</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) seasonally adjusted based on averages of the last 12 months.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
